!data/*/.gitkeep
# Committed exception: the hard-pairs probe dataset's card is prose
# documentation, not data -- it should travel with the repo even though the
# chips/CSVs it describes (data/processed/hard_pairs_dataset/*) do not. A
# negation pattern has no effect once a parent directory is itself excluded
# (git won't descend into it), so the directory is re-included, its contents
# re-excluded, and only then is the one file re-included -- the standard
# three-step gitignore idiom for "ignore a directory except one deep file".
!data/processed/hard_pairs_dataset/
data/processed/hard_pairs_dataset/*
!data/processed/hard_pairs_dataset/DATASET_CARD.md

